**Candidate strategy**:
- Round 1: baseline characterization (Chen2020) — all 6 sims; establishes gap magnitudes; opening ceiling assessment (theoretical ED ceiling with thin CC/optimal porosity; 4C/lowT ceiling with high-transport electrolyte).
- Round 2 (architecture + electrolyte): depending on gaps:
  - ED gap → architecture variant: thicker positive electrode (75.6→~100 µm), thin CCs (Al 16→10 µm, Cu 12→6 µm), N/P tuning. 
