# Case t2_r1_flash — Complete: Design **Achieved** ✅

**Verdict: ACHIEVED** — all 6 adjudicable metrics pass on the final design (FC-C), mechanically verified against the entry-0 criteria (thresholds verbatim from task text, never relaxed).

## Final design (FC-C, NMC811/graphite on Chen2020 base)

| Lever | Value | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| Negative / positive particle radius | 2.5 / 4.0 µm | ↓ solid-diffusion overpotential → lifts anode potential at 4C |
| Negative porosity | 0.30 (from 0.25) | ↓ electrolyte path in negative |
| Electrolyte transport (formulation) | σ 2.0 S/m, D 2.5e-10 m²/s, t⁺ 0.55 | LiFSI-class high-transport (literature-order estimates, marked) |
| SEI kinetic rate constant | 2e-15 m/s (×0.002) | SEI-suppression coating bridge (estimate) |
| Cooling h | 60 W/m²K | active liquid cooling (grid storage) |

## Metric-by-metric (tool output → threshold)

| Metric | Achieved | Threshold | |
|---|---|---|---|
| Energy density | **425.4 Wh/kg** | ≥ 327.18 | ✓ |
| SEI @100 cyc 1C | **78.2 nm** | ≤ 500 nm | ✓ |
| SEI @500 cyc 1C | **262.0 nm** | ≤ 550 nm | ✓ |
| −20 °C retention | **99.4 %** | ≥ 90 % | ✓ |
| 4C fast charge plating | anode min **+12.3 mV > 0** → no plating | none | ✓ |
| 4C T_max (45 °C amb) | **329.2 K** (56.1 °C) | ≤ 333.15 K | ✓ |

## How it was reached (2 rounds, 16 sims)
- **R1 baseline**: ED 400.8 ✓, SEI@100 449.1 ✓, lowT 99.4 % ✓ — but 4C plated (−0.192 V), T_max 354.3 K, SEI@500 777.9 nm ✗. Ceiling assessment → no material bottleneck → no Stage 2 escalation (recorded in funnel log).
- **R2**: FC-A (transport+particles+SEI k×0.2) fixed plating to −0.062 V but not enough; FC-B showed 100 µm negative *worsens* the anode dip (electrolyte path); SEI scans identified k as the controlling lever (i0 is not). FC-C combined everything → **all pass**.

## Audit & deliverables
- `log.jsonl`: 15 entries (criteria → plan → evaluate×2 R1 → propose×3/evaluate×5 R2 → funnel → endorse → final), all via official `bda.store.append_entry` / `log-evaluate`; one file-order collision (T_max judged from lowT file) corrected with an honest same-round corrective entry — append-only preserved.
- `report.html` rendered; `verify-deliverables`: **ALL PASS** (7 categories, PDFs non-empty, xlsx valid, 15 VBF numbers, audit chain complete).
- `deliverables/`: design_spec, datasheet, dvpr, dfmea (md+pdf), bom, calc (xlsx+pdf), delivery_index (md+pdf).
- Honest notes recorded: electrolyte/SEI bridge values are marked `estimate`; true DFT/MD skipped (`real_compute=false`, endorse entry records it); aging capacity-trajectory artifact labeled; nail/overcharge abuse N/A (not in task scope).
